# Pairs with TenantLayerConfined: the tenant layer governs an app-owned tenant tree as if it were a tenant data tree.

MODULE: AppOwnedTreeGoverned
TARGET: TenantLayerConfined
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the tenant layer governs an app-owned tenant tree as if it were a tenant data tree

--- FIND
TenantLayerTree(tree) == tree.kind = "tenant"
--- REPLACE
TenantLayerTree(tree) == tree.kind \in {"tenant", "appOwned"}
--- END
